From 24ea1652509469fb36d190049bf05d3f8116e3b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cheng Fangming <chengfangming1993@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 22:47:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] WIP: advance Iris1 VP9 output buffer setup

Reserve and release a high IOVA window for VP9 capture and DPB buffers, keep output tags disjoint, and restore the legacy split-output configuration after sequence change. Reduce default hot-path tracing and suppress repeated suspend-failure messages.
---
